# Heavy / max-diversity fleet — author's full six.
# Use when quota allows or for high-stakes reviews:
#   bash launch.sh ... --fleet-file "$SKILL_DIR/fleet.full"
#
# Daily default is fleet.defaults (usual five). Same line format.
# Add-back remaining diversity on top of the five:
#   mimopro
# Daily Go seat is none (hy3 and Go glm53 dropped: OpenCode Go quota exhausted).
# Heavy Go seat is mimopro only.
# No OpenRouter seat (oxalpha dropped: stealth/ox-alpha unusable).
# No Antigravity seat (g37flash dropped).
# No extra Cursor seats (k3max, g38flash, musespark dropped: Cursor usage).
# Daily DeepSeek seat: dsv4flash = dsh official deepseek-flash:max (V4.1 Flash).
# SiliconFlow daily seats: glm53 (GLM-5.3 max) + hy4prev (Hy4-preview max).
# oxalpha, hy3, glm52, k27code, dsv4pro, dsflash, dots3, g37flash, k3max, g38flash, and musespark are out of both fleets.
# gpt6astra is official Codex CLI gpt-6-astra:high (cursor gpt-5.6-sol dropped).
# Cursor seat is fable51 only; opencode-go k3 is out of both fleets.
# qwen38max is out unless explicitly --agent'd.

gpt6astra=codex:gpt-6-astra:high
mimopro=opencode-go/mimo-v2.5-pro:max
dsv4flash=dsh:deepseek-flash:max
glm53=siliconflow/zai-org/GLM-5.3:max
hy4prev=siliconflow/tencent/Hy4-preview:max
fable51=cursor:claude-fable-5-1-thinking-high
